    "message": "Replay people and household history between nearby minutes\n\nA people or household history page restored a Checkpoint for every\nsampled minute when the step exceeded five minutes, about 3 s each at\n1440 minutes. Replaying from the previous sampled minute gives the same\nworld, so a page now replays while the gap is at most 60 ticks (about the\ntime of one restore) and restores only across larger gaps. A test compares\nthe samples with restoring every minute.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
